<title>USA: NYC to insure $250 mln of upcoming GOs with MBIA.</title>
<headline>NYC to insure $250 mln of upcoming GOs with MBIA.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>New York City will get bond insurance for about $250 million of bonds from MBIA Insurance Corp, a unit of MBIA Inc, for its offering of $739 million of GOs, which it plans to sell on Wednesday, a city official said on Friday.</p>
<p>The city official, who declined to be named, added that the city might elect to insure more of the bonds.</p>
<p>&quot;We could conceivably do more this week,&quot; he said.</p>
<p>((--Joan Gralla, 212-859-1654))</p>
